    "body": "Critical STACK insertion arguments previously had to retain arbitrary final forests. S010 proves that every stackable one-pebble extension of a STACK loser is clearable, so every critical insertion admits a complete consuming tree. The proof reflects a marked ancestry path after deleting one input from a three-pebble final pile; a separate count derivation checks the reconstruction. Bipartite critical STACK losers consequently have signed imbalance zero.\n\nUniversal ASH* remains OPEN separately for STACK and CLEAR. The session also provides exact root-connected move-count certificates, finite graph-dependent exact port descriptions, full forest cancellation/reversal criteria and a strict quotient restriction for minimal counterexamples. These do not prove global AS extremal selection. CLEAR losers that already stack, changing roots/support/carries, donor piles of two and three-mark forest repair remain explicit obligations. Known grammar/ancestry/+3/signed invariants and earlier TreeStack work are credited; no final-stage activity occurred.\n\nValidation: S00938–43 hostile challenge and 19 inherited check-only commands pass at unchanged scopes; all six new producer/checkers and governance/hash validation pass. Three prior-hashed precision campaigns independently check 37,556 count certificates, 136 complete rooted layers/125,481 configurations, and 21,707 full marked reflections. Weak undirected count connectivity and a graph-wide fixed STACK root on C5 are refuted as auxiliary claims. Historical manifests/cutoffs remain unchanged. This is not independent human/kernel certification. Complete proof/audit/milestone records and an ambitious FUTURE/UNEXECUTED S011 handoff are included.\n\nIntegration pin (post-commit metadata):\n- Entry main and sole authored parent: `a1a38d79003a7081b8e14b59003d4d4641fb05fb`.\n- Single authored S010 head: `243e563aa2b17042409833002b520165fdc3b69f`.\n- Authored tree: `36f4bf59f91afcb2753fa58725d02c772b5c8522`.\n- Actual hosted jobs and outgoing merge/main reread are recorded below. No auto-merge or force.\n\nHead verification (actual objects): run [38649048785](https://github.com/jfairfaxball-348/Almost-Stacked-Proof/actions/runs/38649048785) completed successfully.\n\n| Job/check-run ID | Name | Status | Conclusion |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 116143026708 | validate | completed | success |\n| 116143027040 | s005-replay (2) | completed | success |\n| 116143027043 | s005-replay (0) | completed | success |\n| 116143027114 | s005-replay (1) | completed | success |\n| 116143027229 | s005-replay (3) | completed | success |\n\nAll five head check-runs completed successfully. Commit combined status is pending with zero contexts; no real job remains pending. Remote main was reread immediately before merge and still equals the entry parent. Branch protection404 and empty effective rules/rulesets were reconciled, without changing policy.\n\nActual non-force merge/main pin:\n- Merge/main `6f0d63b023daa5b3424b2ef166e25786f477332a`.\n- Merge tree `36f4bf59f91afcb2753fa58725d02c772b5c8522`, equal to the authored session tree.\n- Ordered merge parents `a1a38d79003a7081b8e14b59003d4d4641fb05fb`, then `243e563aa2b17042409833002b520165fdc3b69f`.\n- GitHub ref/commit and independent `git ls-remote`/local `main` rereads agree; local main fast-forwarded and working tree clean.\n- Main push run [38649652008](https://github.com/jfairfaxball-348/Almost-Stacked-Proof/actions/runs/38649652008) completed successfully; all five actual jobs and check-runs completed successfully.\n\n| Main job/check-run ID | Name | Status | Conclusion |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 116145004088 | validate | completed | success |\n| 116145004456 | s005-replay (3) | completed | success |\n| 116145004483 | s005-replay (1) | completed | success |\n| 116145004488 | s005-replay (0) | completed | success |\n| 116145004517 | s005-replay (2) | completed | success |\n\nMain combined commit status is pending with zero contexts and an empty status list; the actual workflow and all five check-runs are successful. Final local HEAD/main and independent remote main reread both equal `6f0d63b023daa5b3424b2ef166e25786f477332a`; working tree is clean. S010 is complete. S011 remains FUTURE/UNEXECUTED, and all deferred final-stage activities remain unexecuted.",
